# #345: silicon arithmetic in the constant-writeback evaluator. The Android
# CMake build applies the same file (android/app/src/main/cpp/CMakeLists.txt).
# meson applies it only when it downloads the subproject: an existing
# checkout needs `meson subprojects update --reset nv2a_vsh_cpu`.
